      "description": "Compact selected and unselected categories.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-chip ds-selected\" aria-current=\"page\">All finds</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-chip\">Stationery</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:15px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line,#d6d6ca);font-family:\"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-chip{padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:3px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#57636a);font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}.ds-chip.ds-selected{background:var(--ink,#17232b);color:var(--background,#f1f0e6)}.ds-chip:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#c17127);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chip{transition:none;transform:none}}",
      "refersTo": "filter-selected"
    },
    {
      "name": "Desktop navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Compact horizontal storefront navigation; mobile remains a menu.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"#\">Products</a><a href=\"#\">Offers</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--sidebar,#eeeee4);padding:12px;font-family:\"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:3px;color:var(--muted,#57636a);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav a:hover{background:var(--soft,#e8e7dc);color:var(--ink,#17232b)}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{background:var(--nav-active-bg,#e6dcc5);color:var(--nav-active-fg,#743b0e)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#c17127);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Experiment ticket",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Material and switch preview; application binds live offer and purchase behavior.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-ticket\"><header>Monday / UTC <span>Weekend offer</span></header><p class=\"ds-question\">The weekend is over.<br>Should this deal still work?</p><label class=\"ds-switch\"><span>Break the weekend rule</span><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\"></label><p class=\"ds-expectation\">Expected: purchase blocked</p><button>Try the offer on Monday ?</button><small>Real shop. Fictional credit. No real payment.</small></article>",
      "css": ".ds-ticket{width:360px;max-width:100%;padding:23px;background:#f0e9d9;color:#17232b;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 20px 45px #0004;font-family:\"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-ticket header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #a8ac9d;padding-bottom:12px;font-family:\"Field Display\",sans-serif;font-size:15px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}.ds-question{font-family:\"Field Serif\",serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.12;margin:16px 0}.ds-switch{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:13px 0;border-block:1px solid #bdc0b2;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ds-switch input{appearance:none;width:40px;height:24px;border:1px solid #92998e;border-radius:16px;background:#d6d6c7;position:relative;cursor:pointer}.ds-switch input:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#515e58;transition:transform .2s}.ds-switch input:checked{background:#a5552d;border-color:#a5552d}.ds-switch input:checked:before{transform:translateX(16px);background:#fff8e8}.ds-expectation{font-size:11px;margin:13px 0;font-weight:700}.ds-ticket button{width:100%;min-height:44px;border:0;border-radius:3px;background:#17232b;color:#fff6e1;padding:10px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-ticket button:hover{background:#304249}.ds-ticket small{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:9px;color:#4d5954;margin-top:12px}.ds-ticket button:focus-visible,.ds-switch input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#c17127);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-switch input:before{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "experiment-ticket"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Field Guide",
    "overview": "A photographic shop paired with a tangible experiment slip: midnight navy, ivory and parchment, warm amber actions, compressed display type, and an italic serif counterpoint. Large editorial gestures introduce the experience; restrained controls support everyday shopping and evidence inspection.\n\nRelease Verification Lab is the portfolio project; Fieldwork is its fictional shop. The current visual world replaces the rejected bland purple dashboard direction. This document records the implemented system, not approval of a separate generated direction image. Storefront-specific typography and horizontal navigation do not imply an admin layout redesign; admin retains its existing structure and consumes the shared palette.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Product photography anchors the composition.",
      "Condensed uppercase display type pairs with expressive serif titles and plain body copy.",
      "Paper-like controls sit against midnight imagery.",
      "Amber indicates actions; pass/fail retains independent semantic colors."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Color Rule",
        "body": "Amber is an action accent. Green and red remain reserved for success and failure; expected behavior alone is not a verified result.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use existing product photography and local responsive image variants.",
      "**Do** keep display gestures short and operational controls readable.",
      "**Do** preserve theme roles, semantic results, visible focus, and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "**Do** retain real runner, guide, role, cart, and checkout behavior under visual changes."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** return to the rejected bland purple dashboard direction.",
      "**Don't** convert expected behavior into a fabricated pass result.",
      "**Don't** apply storefront navigation or hero typography to admin by assumption.",
      "**Don't** treat a generated direction image as shipped artwork or user-approved publication."
    ]
  }
}
